<title>USA: Lernout &amp; Hauspie to acquire technology.</title>
<headline>Lernout &amp; Hauspie to acquire technology.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lernout &amp; Hauspie Speech Products NV said Sunday it has agreed to acquire Centigram Communications Corp's text-to-speech TruVoice technology and business.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Lernout &amp; Hauspie will issue about 200,000 shares of its common stock, valued at about $5 million.</p>
<p>L&amp;H said it will integrate TruVoice text-to-speech (TTS) software into its existing family of TTS technologies and applications. The TruVoice technology and products analyze text input and convert it into natural sounding speech.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
